 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 233063,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/d03794b4c03eded7.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work from The Regents of the University of California)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>Hershey and Chase were running experiments to understand which molecule transfered genes. They were suspecting DNA and proteins as the possible molecules.</p>\n<p>Hershey and Chase marked some viruses with radioactive sulfur and phosphorous.  Then they let the viruses infect some bacteria. They then centrifuged the mixture. The heavier bacteria, also contiaining viral DNA, would sink to the bottom. The remaining parts of the viruses floated to the top. The graph shows what Hershey and Chase detected at the top.</p>\n<p>Based on the graph, what can be said about DNA and proteins?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 722397,
     "content_html": "Proteins contain higher amounts sulfur. DNA contains higher amounts of phosphorous."
    },
    {
     "id": 722396,
     "content_html": "Proteins contain higher amounts phosphorous. DNA contains higher amounts of sulfur."
    },
    {
     "id": 722398,
     "content_html": "Both proteins and DNA contain high amounts of sulfur."
    },
    {
     "id": 722395,
     "content_html": "Both proteins and DNA contain high amounts of phosphorous."
    }
   ],
